<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon’s BIR rapid-intervention force has expanded around Lake Chad while drones and joint border patrols continue targeting Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest, where attacks on government forces persist. Troops killed four suspected separatists after a deadly village attack, and the government suspended Issa Tchiroma’s political party for three months. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sportstar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPeVptRXNVcHBvdHZ2bE41clh3UkU1WDJBZHh6T2VLOFF2ZlRJUVRYSGNCMGJoRThfOTlESWNHbmplVjY2cHgxX1NBTjhSaVJuaEc1N1RyajhJNXRNTGhmRTdteDdTV1F0MGdGb0tMX05iZ3R5anRIWDNIV2t0X1l5M2ZKcjd4WFVHTUh1MlNnMUtPRlNf?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOZjZJRHY2eWZRanBCZFFsVS10N3Q5SEIweUpsS0E1N0djYjFSMW9YOG9CazVSVUQ5bF9aTGdHYXRvWXNOOFFjTEIxcVVhMTVDU2p4MnlNbW0zZlplTnJKTGlfXzNnX2pIeXk3amFxdjFsWmZIZkVJNnFhMm5DMVZiT0YyTTYwQnBPMWh6SlJmTU0wTDV4QUttaFlaS28?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQSEEzWnVwV2VHeWFFdEp6OTVIdVpjdFFxSTV2cWRwMzdmOThNUWc0LXNrWmFqQmVfZ0hkOHhOVnhkR2tNM0o5ZHJpTVExSmxqN3pwX3JnUG1jVjktWXV6cVNQdVhYU1ZQbGlodXh3b3ZkZ2tnR0JEa09zdFBrU2RMTFJlLVdWRDhTcV9OMklOa2g0TlM1TW8wNHFPRjVKQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CameroonOnline.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV